{#- A standing row's total (competition toolkit A7 + T6): the penalised total; when pieces are missing, the time, the
    penalty and the missing pieces under it. Variables: row (StandingRow), breakdown_class (optional - the public page
    shows it here from lg up only, under the name on phones). -#}
<span class="lb-time-value" data-standing-total>{{ row.totalSeconds|puzzlingTime }}</span>
{{- include('standing/_breakdown.html.twig', {class: 'd-block text-nowrap ' ~ breakdown_class|default('')}) -}}
